  "definition": "Labeling of Seed Distributed to Wholesalers",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-07-21",
  "historyNote": "#6495, eff 4-23-97, EXPIRED: 4-23-05 New. #12469, INTERIM, eff 1-26-18, EXPIRES: 7-25-18; ss by #12576, eff 7-21-18",
